Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.36,0:00:09.11,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs24\an8\fnArial\c&H988683&\3c&HF2F2F2&\b1}Guesthouse Inn Ishimochi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:26.28,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Kyu,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.94,0:00:30.01,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,would you stop by and see Grandpa \Non your way home today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:32.00,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yeah. Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.36,0:00:35.24,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.52,0:00:39.77,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs24\an8\fnArial\c&H6A6770&\3c&HF1F2EF&\b1}Guesthouse Inn Ishimochi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.11,0:00:52.15,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,Kyusho-kun! Your bag, your bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.06,0:00:57.16,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.16,0:00:59.04,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H323839&\3c&H97CCA7&\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\pos(320,108)\fad(1,273)}Thank You for Choosing Us\N{\fnArial\b1}Kinme Cleaning
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.52,0:00:58.40,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:09.12,Flashback,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Wow, it's so clean now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.12,0:01:11.55,Flashback,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Come on, Kyu. Say thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.89,0:01:14.55,Flashback,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.55,0:01:20.72,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,Not at all. Thank you very much \Nfor choosing Kinme Cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.34,0:01:59.44,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\fs36\c&HB8B74C&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz8.498\\clip(160,82,167,129)\t(16,893,1 \clip(153,76,277,123))\pos(164,88)\fad(1,187)}Wash {\c&H121A2E&}It
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.32,0:01:59.44,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\fs36\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz8.498\clip(269,73,271,114)\pos(282,71)\fad(1,187)\clip(267,73,276,116)\t(6,1007,1,\clip(275,58,417,107)\c&H121A2E&}All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:12.46,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(481,478)\fs13\shad2\c&H222C04&\3c&HEEDCCF&\blur0\bord1\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\4c&HC7CD96&\pos(131,16)}Episode{\c&H8065C7&} 11   {\c&H222C04&}To Help This {\c&H8F8B3E&\3c&HEDD7D3&}Little Guy {\c&H222C04&}Out
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.59,0:03:15.59,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,So the lead character wears glasses \Nand is super quiet so I thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.59,0:03:17.50,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,hey, is that me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.50,0:03:18.59,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,He's lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.59,0:03:20.82,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Huh? Kyu, am I loud?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.20,0:03:33.06,Default,Male Teacher,0,0,0,,Today, I want to talk to you \Nabout inflected forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.06,0:03:36.92,Default,Male Teacher,0,0,0,,For example, the modern "omowanai" \Nturns into "omowazu,"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.92,0:03:41.99,Default,Male Teacher,0,0,0,,"omoimashita" becomes "omoikeri," \N"omou" becomes "omofu," and "omou toki"...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.16,0:03:55.66,Default,Track Member,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.66,0:03:56.96,Default,Classmate,0,0,0,,He's fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.99,0:03:59.31,Default,Track Member,0,0,0,,Yo, Kyu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.05,0:04:03.14,Default,Track Member,0,0,0,,You really should join the track club.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.23,0:04:09.14,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,It's already... second year... \NProbably too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.14,0:04:11.53,Default,Track Member,0,0,0,,Nah, it would be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.53,0:04:16.65,Default,Track Member,0,0,0,,Seriously, give it some thought. We don't \Nhave a middle-distance runner right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.18,0:04:21.26,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yeah, but... \NI still have to help at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.27,0:04:24.91,Default,Track Member,0,0,0,,I figured you'd say something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.47,0:04:27.41,Default,Track Member,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll just have to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.17,0:04:39.46,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Okay, see ya later!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.95,0:04:39.05,Default,Student,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.91,0:04:52.34,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Kyu-kun, why are you so \Nspaced out recently? Not sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.34,0:04:55.19,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Kyu's always out of orbit somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.19,0:04:56.28,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.22,0:05:00.32,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,But you gotta get enough sleep, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.68,0:05:01.66,Default - Top,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Yeah, I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:00.98,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.98,0:05:02.95,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,I'm asleep five seconds \Nafter I hit the pillow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.71,0:05:09.50,Default,Female Teacher,0,0,0,,Listen up. It's normal to want to find \Nthe easiest way to solve a math equation,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.50,0:05:11.83,Default,Female Teacher,0,0,0,,but once you realize\N there's this other method,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.83,0:05:14.29,Default,Female Teacher,0,0,0,,things start to get interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.34,0:05:20.22,Default,Female Teacher,0,0,0,,All right, so let's see you use this \Nformula to determine the value.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.76,0:05:22.28,Default,Female Teacher,0,0,0,,Sato-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.71,0:05:28.66,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.66,0:05:32.85,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,Um, would you mind if we slept\N in the same room tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.42,0:05:37.36,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Did I wake you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.66,0:05:41.11,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,Just now in the bath,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.59,0:05:47.10,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,I started wondering about what could \Nhave caused me to be so afraid of thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.63,0:05:54.08,Default,Female Teacher,0,0,0,,Okay, that's about all \Nwe have time for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.52,0:05:56.72,Default,Female Teacher,0,0,0,,Be sure to review this at home, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.41,0:06:08.16,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Man, I didn't catch a single word in math.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.26,0:06:10.89,Default,Female Teacher,0,0,0,,Ishimochi? Wakasagi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.89,0:06:11.64,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.95,0:06:17.16,Default,Female Teacher,0,0,0,,Are you boys getting enough rest? \NYou're sleeping in class a lot recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.16,0:06:18.56,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Ah, whoops.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.56,0:06:20.15,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.15,0:06:22.94,Default,Female Teacher,0,0,0,,Oh boy. Try to stay awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.88,0:06:26.16,Default,Female Teacher,0,0,0,,Oh, that's so clean!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.52,0:06:29.66,Default,Female Teacher,0,0,0,,A clean bag says a lot about a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.72,0:06:33.16,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.33,0:06:36.24,Default,Female Teacher,0,0,0,,On the other hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.82,0:06:36.63,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.24,0:06:38.75,Default,Female Teacher,0,0,0,,Wakasagi, your bag looks like trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.75,0:06:43.04,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Yeah. I was actually planning \Nto wash it this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.55,0:06:58.98,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Huh? Aren't you getting off, Kyu-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.98,0:06:59.69,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.69,0:07:01.42,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Oh. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.42,0:07:03.51,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,I gotta go see my grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.51,0:07:04.45,Default,Kuriru,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.45,0:07:05.63,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.63,0:07:07.14,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yeah. See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.14,0:07:11.45,Italics Top,Announcement,0,0,0,,The doors of the train on track two \Nare closing. Please stand clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.49,0:07:50.32,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\move(128,102,-10,102)\shad0\fnArial\fs12\b1\c&H413F3B&\3c&HB7B2AD&}Suzuki\NFamily Grave
