Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.12,0:07:55.75,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnArial\fs14\b1\c&H413F3B&\3c&H9DA5A4&\move(312,39,315,361,0,3605)}Ishimochi Family
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.89,0:08:20.52,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnArial\fs14\b1\c&H0D529A&\3c&H00A1E9&\move(312,39,315,361,0,3605)}Ishimochi Family
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.44,0:08:30.40,Italics,Kyusho (M),0,0,0,,I might as well go up \Nto the top while I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.54,0:08:37.79,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs22\b1\c&H0DC0E9&\3c&H024780&\an8}Izukai Shrine
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.64,0:08:45.12,Italics,Kyusho (M),0,0,0,,The climb is always a pain, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.39,0:08:51.23,Italics,Kyusho (M),0,0,0,,At least it's easier now \Nthan when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.49,0:08:56.18,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.18,0:08:58.62,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Kinme-san? What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.62,0:09:01.44,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,What are {\i1}you{\i0} doing here, Kyusho-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.44,0:09:06.09,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Well, I did some cleaning and I thought \NI'd visit the shrine while I'm at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.44,0:09:07.44,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Cleaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.44,0:09:11.44,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Um, my grandpa's grave is down below.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.44,0:09:14.70,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, so you were cleaning the grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.70,0:09:19.20,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Mom usually takes care of it, \Nbut she asked me to come today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.20,0:09:21.21,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.21,0:09:25.21,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It's so responsible of you \Nto pay respect to your ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.20,0:09:29.01,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yeah, but it's no exaggeration to say
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.01,0:09:33.34,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be here without \Nmy grandpa and family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.19,0:09:38.50,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,That's such a nice way to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.85,0:09:43.98,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Kyusho-kun, that's one reason \NI think I like you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.99,0:09:51.89,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Um, Kinme-san, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.89,0:09:52.77,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.77,0:09:55.49,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,I've been wondering \Nabout something, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.54,0:10:15.76,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? What? Kyusho-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.92,0:10:58.93,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\fs22\c&HC4C480&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz9.132\pos(78,24)}Wash {\c&0000000&}It All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.93,0:11:03.93,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\fs22\c&HC4C480&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz9.132\pos(420,243)}Wash {\c&0000000&}It All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.02,0:11:10.82,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I am a little \Nbacked up at the moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.82,0:11:14.62,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,so I'm afraid it will take \None day longer than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.62,0:11:16.26,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Is that still all right with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.26,0:11:17.95,Default,Regular,0,0,0,,Yes, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.95,0:11:22.95,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you very much. \NAs always, you can count on Kinme!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.03,0:11:25.78,Default,Regular,0,0,0,,I'll see you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.78,0:11:26.88,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.84,0:11:34.30,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Hello, Kinme-oneesan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.30,0:11:37.34,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, hello. Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.60,0:11:40.47,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,Hello. Looks like you're keeping busy.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.47,0:11:43.47,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,{\an1}Yes, I sure am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.64,0:11:47.73,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(687,1)\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HC89668&\frz359.9\fscx33\fscy9\pos(289.5,24)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
