Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.68,0:11:47.73,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(687,1)\fnArial\b1\fs12\shad0\an8\c&HB1806C&\3c&HF4E8D0&\pos(404,219)}September-October \N {\fs10}(Putting Away\NSummer Clothes)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.68,0:11:47.73,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(687,1)\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HC3F3FF&\frz359.9\fscx53\fscy27\pos(403.5,290)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.68,0:11:47.73,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(687,1)\fnArial\b1\fs9\shad0\an8\c&H639FE1&\3c&HC3F3FF&\pos(403,306)}End & Beginning of Year\N(Yearly Cleaning)
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.47,0:11:47.28,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,{\an1}We do get a lot of business \Naround this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.98,0:11:45.35,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&H6166CE&\frz359.9\fscx18\fscy11\pos(314.5,230)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
