Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:47.73,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&H6166CE&\frz359.9\fscx18\fscy11\pos(314.5,230)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.60,0:11:47.73,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs14\an6\shad0\c&HEFF1F9&\3c&H6166CE&\pos(343,241)}Here Now
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.73,0:11:52.20,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sorry to bother you, then,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.20,0:11:54.91,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,but may I still ask you \Nto clean these for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.91,0:11:58.70,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, of course! Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.80,0:11:58.52,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.92,0:12:03.99,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Are you taking more pictures \Nfor social media?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.99,0:12:04.94,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.50,0:12:11.00,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Mother, I'd like to take some more \Npictures before I go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:12.13,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.74,0:12:16.75,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,Is that all right? \NIt's such a busy time for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.75,0:12:19.13,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,I will not get in her way one bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.12,0:12:22.39,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, it's fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.39,0:12:25.89,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,I see. Well, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.89,0:12:29.90,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,Nairo, do not cause her \Nany trouble at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.90,0:12:31.07,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.40,0:12:48.30,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Don't you think we've taken \Nenough of this kind of picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.30,0:12:49.92,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Oh, definitely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.19,0:12:55.42,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,We need newer pictures of you working\N to keep appearing on the timeline!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.25,0:12:58.42,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I guess that's how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.42,0:13:03.95,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Yes! But videos actually get \Nmore attention than pictures do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.83,0:13:06.75,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,See, like this one.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.18,0:13:11.84,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,The number of views is... Ten thousand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.63,0:13:12.55,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(285,1)\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\frz359.9\frz22.87\fscx163\fscy49\pos(364.5,250)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.63,0:13:12.55,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnArial\shad0\fs17\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&H717578&\fad(285,1)\frz22.87\pos(194,287)}10,126 Views
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.63,0:13:12.55,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(285,1)\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\frz359.9\frz22.87\fscx71\fscy15\pos(257.5,257)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.63,0:13:12.55,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnArial\shad0\fs15\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&H717578&\fad(285,1)\frz22.87\pos(215,323)}Here is Kinme-san, the owner of Kinme Cleaning, treating a \Nstain on a customer's garment! She works very carefully, \Napplying a series of detergents to safely remove the stain.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.84,0:13:14.10,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm the same way,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.10,0:13:18.44,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,but everyone seems to be really interested \Nin your stain-removing steam sprayer!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.44,0:13:22.68,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,So I would love to take another video \Nof you removing stains today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.68,0:13:27.63,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hmm. But I've already pretty much \Nfinished stain treatment for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.48,0:13:33.33,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Oh? What is that over there? \NThere's a square on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.33,0:13:35.34,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? A square?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.59,0:13:39.95,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.95,0:13:41.59,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Is it some kind of door?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.88,0:13:43.61,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.61,0:13:45.47,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,You mean you've never opened it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.47,0:13:50.84,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,No. I tried to open it once \Nsoon after I started here,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.84,0:13:53.53,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,but the handle was stuck, so I gave up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.53,0:14:04.38,Default - Top,Kinme,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.53,0:14:04.38,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.39,0:14:16.00,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.97,0:14:22.44,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Nairo-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.01,0:14:24.33,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Nairo-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.30,0:14:28.20,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Um, um, let's open it right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.20,0:14:32.39,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,We might make a great discovery! \NLet's get some torches ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.39,0:14:34.27,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? Torches?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.77,0:14:41.06,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Last time, I wasn't able to open it \Nby pulling on the handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.28,0:14:45.63,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,So maybe if I try this...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.03,0:14:46.90,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.90,0:14:48.41,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,It's open!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.54,0:14:55.95,Italics,Nairo,0,0,0,,Sigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.79,0:14:59.96,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Wow, so it just comes right off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.30,0:15:04.14,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I figured it was underfloor storage space.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.43,0:15:04.88,Default - Top,Nairo,0,0,0,,My castle...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.14,0:15:08.24,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I wonder if these belong to the owner \Nof the previous cleaning shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.34,0:15:13.30,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Everything looks very worn out and rusty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.30,0:15:15.06,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Yes, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.62,0:15:18.20,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,What could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.20,0:15:19.94,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Find something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.31,0:15:22.94,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,A stuffed animal?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.94,0:15:27.70,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,There's a hole torn in the bag,\N so it's grown filthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:30.82,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,There's a receipt!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.47,0:15:37.12,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Which means this must be an item that\Na customer brought in to be cleaned.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.71,0:15:45.60,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Looks like it is very moldy \Nand discolored.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.60,0:15:47.66,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,I feel kind of bad for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.66,0:15:52.22,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Underfloor spaces are humid \Nand have poor air circulation,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.48,0:15:55.70,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,so they aren't really suitable \Nfor storing things made of fabric.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.82,0:16:00.94,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,So why keep a customer's \Nprecious stuffed animal there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.56,0:16:07.51,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Aji-san did tell me that this building \Nwas used for another cleaning shop
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.36,0:16:09.61,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HB789E7&\frz359.9\pos(92.5,7)\fscx75\fscy48}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.36,0:16:09.61,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs30\c&HA3EFFE&\3c&HBA86E9&\shad0\pos(93.6,42)}Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.36,0:16:09.61,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HEAEDED&\frz359.9\pos(93.5,44)\fscx67\fscy28}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.36,0:16:09.61,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\b1\fs25\c&HEEC860&\3c&HEAEDED&\shad0\pos(20.6,47)}2x Points\NEvery Tuesday
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.51,0:16:09.61,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,long before I moved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.26,0:16:13.37,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,If that previous manager \Nis responsible for this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.71,0:16:18.28,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,as a cleaner myself, I do not approve.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.87,0:16:22.61,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,What's wrong? \NYou look upset about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.61,0:16:25.63,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.90,0:16:28.58,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,But I should try to contact the owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.71,0:16:37.77,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hmm. I can't get through \Nto the number on the receipt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.39,0:16:41.21,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,There is an address, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.22,0:16:45.65,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Um, so what do you plan \Nto do with the stuffed animal?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.60,0:16:48.28,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.28,0:16:52.68,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,961)\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\c&H848A92&\3c&HB3D3E2&\an7}Collection Receipt\N {\fs14}Location:\N {\fs14}Name: {\fs18}Mutsu-sama\N\N{\fs14}Date Received: June 4 \NScheduled Pick-up Date: June 25\N\NPlease bring this receipt when you come to pick up your item.\N We cannot be held responsible for items that are not claimed within one month.\N\N Item: Stuffed Animal
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.71,0:16:52.58,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,If this was meant for \Nthe previous shop to clean,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.58,0:16:56.37,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,it might seem a bit presumptuous \Nfor me to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.56,0:17:02.38,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Then again, I can't just leave \Nsomething so dirty in this state.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.08,0:17:05.92,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I am going to wash it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.80,0:17:20.06,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,I'm also doing it to help this \Nlittle guy out, after being trapped
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.66,0:17:22.56,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,alone in the dark for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:32.57,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.03,0:17:36.56,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Can you explain what \Nyou're doing right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.56,0:17:38.40,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm press-washing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.83,0:17:41.41,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Stuffed animals are filled with padding,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.41,0:17:45.62,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,so I put a small amount of mildly acidic \Ncommercial detergent in warm water
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.62,0:17:49.34,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,and press it gently to wash the insides.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.76,0:17:54.48,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Wow! It's like the little guy \Nis taking a bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.85,0:18:06.29,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,After press-washing, I rinse it \Ntwo or three times the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.86,0:18:11.11,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It isn't always clear what plush toys \Nlike this are stuffed with,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.11,0:18:16.87,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,so it is best not to soak them completely \Nunless absolutely necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.87,0:18:20.40,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Also, if you aren't careful to \Ndry them completely afterwards,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.40,0:18:23.87,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,they can easily become \Na breeding ground for mold.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.13,0:18:35.14,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,And then, and then, \Nwhat do you do after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.66,0:18:36.86,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I dry it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.39,0:18:41.47,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,You're going to spin it around?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.47,0:18:45.14,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,If you spin it too hard, the stuffing \Ncould get bunched up
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.14,0:18:46.90,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,and change the shape of the toy,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.33,0:18:51.53,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,so I keep a close eye on the time \Nand temperature and just dry it partway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.53,0:18:55.91,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Huh? Didn't you say you needed \Nto dry it completely?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.20,0:19:00.16,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, so after this, I'll take him \Nto the back yard to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.83,0:19:02.83,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.92,0:19:12.02,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It's a flat drying net.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.02,0:19:15.43,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I hang it in the shade \Nuntil it dries and then I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.43,0:19:18.68,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,This is going to be a popular post!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.93,0:19:25.34,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Nairo-chan, would you mind \Nnot posting this quite yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.34,0:19:25.94,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Huh?
