Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.94,0:19:36.79,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Where did it come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.95,0:19:42.11,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Aji-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.11,0:19:43.08,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.99,0:19:48.46,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Someone from the moving company \Nmight have stuffed it under the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.46,0:19:49.62,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Moving company?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.62,0:19:54.46,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,When the last cleaner closed shop, \NI left everything to a moving company.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.46,0:19:59.30,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,I had them clean everything and even \Nsort through all the equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.30,0:20:04.87,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Those bums had the nerve to tell me there \Nwasn't anything in the underfloor storage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.87,0:20:06.35,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.66,0:20:12.02,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,What a mess. I should have \Nchecked it myself to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.02,0:20:16.49,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, I never bothered \Nto look inside until now either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.49,0:20:21.49,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,But I don't have any idea who \Nbrought that stuffed animal in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.39,0:20:30.18,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,It's really far up the hill, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.18,0:20:31.51,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.51,0:20:33.75,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,We can see the ocean in the distance!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.75,0:20:35.40,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Wow, we really can!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.13,0:20:37.85,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Is it around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.85,0:20:40.13,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hmm. It should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.48,0:20:43.64,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Do you think they remember \Nbringing the stuffed animal in?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.63,0:20:46.64,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I certainly hope they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.64,0:20:49.02,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.02,0:20:50.12,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I think this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.52,0:20:57.65,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Oh no! There isn't even a house here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.65,0:21:00.53,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,K-Kinme-oneesan, what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.53,0:21:03.08,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Should we go ahead and post about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.62,0:21:06.02,Flashback Italics,Aji,0,0,0,,You know, it could've been a family \Nwith a vacation home here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.05,0:21:08.98,Flashback,Aji,0,0,0,,{\fad(465,1)}You know, it could've been a family \Nwith a vacation home here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.98,0:21:10.29,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,Vacation home?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.29,0:21:15.34,Flashback,Aji,0,0,0,,Then they might have stopped visiting \Nhere and forgot to go pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.34,0:21:16.80,Flashback,Aji,0,0,0,,That could happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.80,0:21:21.30,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,If that's the case, what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.59,0:21:26.15,Flashback,Aji,0,0,0,,There's really nothing to do. \NDo whatever feels right to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.47,0:21:30.06,Flashback,Aji,0,0,0,,Everything happens for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.94,0:21:36.60,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Kinme-oneesan?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.63,0:21:43.82,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I think I'll take it back to the shop \Nand take care of it for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.82,0:21:44.82,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.82,0:21:48.50,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Especially since it's all clean now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.16,0:21:58.20,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Does this look all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.20,0:21:58.84,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.84,0:22:02.84,sign_31621_332_Do_you_recognize,text,0,0,0,,{\move(316,94,316,87)\frz359.4\fad(1,1896)}Do you recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.84,0:22:02.84,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,1896)\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\fscx145\fscy32\move(310.5,292,312.5,293,19,2229)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.84,0:22:02.84,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(1,1896)\fnArial\shad0\fs11\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&H717578&\frz0.05103\move(145,292,145,300,19,2271)}Does anyone out there recognize me?\N\N I've found a stuffed animal that was left by the previous cleaners.\N The family at the address that was left have moved away,\N so I haven't been able to return him to his owner.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.44,0:22:01.41,Default - Top,Kinme,0,0,0,,I hope his owners find him.
